              <strong>Line 1 (Orders):</strong> +91 99055 61443 | <strong>Line 2 (Support):</strong> +91 98356 54983 | <strong>GSTIN:</strong> 10REAPK9623A1ZS | <strong>FSSAI Lic:</strong> 10018064001572
            </div>
